      {
        "author_name": "Kahhor Gaffarov",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102099833327065899880/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUzOXUw3oQDof2yEto4bLuwlSdTNu_hD5bCj4uB9nepcY4pS2ab=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "We recently had the pleasure of working with Normand, and our home-buying experience was nothing short of exceptional. What sets Normand apart from other realtors is his genuine commitment to ensuring that his clients find not just a house, but a home that perfectly suits their needs.\n\nOne standout quality is Normand's refreshing honesty. Unlike other realtors we encountered, Normand doesn't just focus on the positives to close a deal quickly. He takes the time to highlight both the positive and negative aspects of a property, ensuring that you make an informed decision. This honesty builds trust and confidence in his clients, making the entire process more transparent and stress-free.\n\nWhat truly impressed us was Normand's extensive knowledge of the areas he serves. He goes beyond just providing information about the houses; Normand is well-versed in the local geography, understanding where potential issues like water accumulation or shifting land may arise. This in-depth knowledge is invaluable, as it ensures that you not only know about the house but also understand the surrounding environment.\n\nNormand's dedication to his clients extends to researching and sharing the history of many houses. This added layer of information creates a connection between the buyer and the property, making the decision-making process more personal and meaningful.\n\nIf you are in the market for a property in Vaudreuil, Rigaud, Hudson, Saint-Lazare, Les Cedres, Coteau-du-Lac, Ile-Perrot, or surrounding areas, look no further than Normand. His professionalism, honesty, and unparalleled knowledge make him a standout real estate broker. Normand exceeded our expectations, and we have no doubt that he will do the same for anyone looking for their dream home. Thank you, Normand, for making our home-buying journey truly exceptional!",
        "time": 1701403010,
        "translated": false
      },
