        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIV50B27HhsguhHSmCj6jvabHCHVPfnkVjhM-WWS_lA4cfN-A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Choosing Normand Roy as your broker is a guarantee of uncompromising security. Technically and personally, you're treated like a VIP with him. Normand guided us through every detail: market research, marketing, photography, social media, notary services, etc.\n\nThank you, Normand, and thank you to your secretary, Ms. Francine Phaneuf, who does an exemplary job. I highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1764710339,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cecile Morin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113770251136709198508/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVzYSrf_zVyJ9VKQRoLxbD2KBQZzVtB3SiKoqTtSX1bgHdUG54=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Experience with Normand Roy, Real Estate Broker\nAcknowledgements and Availability\nI would like to warmly thank Normand Roy for his exceptional support throughout the sale of our house. Even four years after the transaction, he remained available to address a sensitive situation.\n\nRemarkable Professionalism\nFrom our very first meeting, Normand Roy's professionalism, market knowledge, and attentiveness immediately impressed us. He created an atmosphere of trust and ease through his approach.\nTransparent and Effective Support\nNormand Roy guided every step of the process, from showcasing the property to showings and negotiations. The property sold within a month on the market in a limited price range, while adhering to the established strategy.\nOutstanding Personal Qualities\nBeyond his technical skills, Normand Roy's humanity, availability, and attentiveness truly made the experience memorable. His services are recommended without hesitation to anyone looking for a trustworthy real estate broker.\nThank you again for everything! Ms. C. Morin",
        "time": 1753796797,
        "translated": true
      },
